(F5 T2 V5: element_intpnt_dof (manual Professional 6.437, unknowns per
 element in the integration points, point-major, npoint*nuknwn values) of
 a unit quad4, default 2x2 Gauss rule, 10 unknowns (velx vely disx disy
 sigxx sigxy sigxz sigyy sigyz sigzz): 40 values. Source: Professional
 02-08-2026 probe intq (same input). Every slot equals the Professional
 within 1e-11 except the disx/disy slots: the Professional writes 0 there,
 the GNU integration-point storage carries the displacement (h-interpolated
 node displacement; class B divergence ELEMENT-DOF-DISPLACEMENT). The
 expected line (scripts/build_safe.sh) holds the Professional values with
 the GNU displacement slots; tolerance 1e-5 of the largest value.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
print_group_data -group_materi_elasti_young -group_materi_elasti_poisson
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
